<resources>
    <!-- DESIGN.md section 2. Warm near-black, deliberately never #000000. -->
    <color name="crate_black">#17120F</color>
    <!--
        The ground the app opens on: the splash, the title card over the room, and the still
        splash below Android 12. Pure black, the one place it is right - there is no room yet and
        nothing is lit, and on an OLED panel these are pixels that never come on, so the lit mark
        hangs in front of the phone instead of being printed on it. One colour for all three, or
        the hand-over between the system's splash and the card shows as a step.
    -->
    <color name="opening_black">#000000</color>
